Notebook[{
Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Quit", "[", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.960535490341683*^9, 3.960535491727968*^9}, {
  3.971396946078047*^9, 3.971396946571454*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7f5e2c81-1d05-48cb-a770-61316a7686e8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook contains the main modules that are common to all SM and BSM \
scenarios.\nDeveloped by M. Escudero, G. Jackson, M. Laine and S. Sandner in \
[2511.04747] \nv1 from M. Escudero in [1812.05605] and [2001.04466]\n\nIt \
includes:\n\n1) Constants and parameters used throughout calculations.\n2) \
QED finite temperature corrections to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", "\[Gamma]e"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "320c2733-c3c0-4ee8-92db-ecabdd3ea62c"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["P", "\[Gamma]e"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e77e636c-a6f3-46a7-9c9d-d9c661b7ae2b"],
 " up to order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["e", "5"], "."}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "cbfebda8-8cb4-45bd-a2d8-f452a119bf30"],
 "\n\tThe default is just to load and interpolate them from a file up to \
order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["e", "3"], "."}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f19dd263-0160-461f-a439-fe998f85307a"],
 "\n3) The Standard Model energy and number density transfer rate for \[Nu]-\
\[Nu]  and \[Nu]-e interactions.\n\tWe use a linear response approximation \
for them.\n4) Relevant thermodynamic formulae for n, \[Rho], p and their \
derivatives for particles following FD and BE statistics.\n\tThe formulae for \
massive ones have been written by default as sum of Bessel integrals.\n\nWe \
note that all dimensionful variables are in MeV but the rates, Hubble and t \
which are in seconds. \n\nNote: this file is used to generate the .m file \
correctly. If you want to load the files locally on this notebook, then you \
should go to \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]To get the correct .m file\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and uncomment the line \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]packageDir = NotebookDirectory[]\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]."
}], "Text",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.770023972949883*^9, 3.770023980572762*^9}, {
   3.770024020884617*^9, 3.770024438596882*^9}, {3.770024470697006*^9, 
